{"availability":"available","full":"ObservedObserver/streamlit-shadcn-ui-docs","name":"streamlit-shadcn-ui-docs","description":"docs and examples of streamlit-shadcn-ui","category":"Other","language":"Python","stars":59,"forks":22,"created":"2023-11-22T09:16:52Z","updated":"2026-09-08T11:18:05Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://shadcn.streamlit.app/","topics":["shadcn","shadcn-ui","streamlit"],"demo":"https://shadcn.streamlit.app/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T15:46:57.813Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-06T15:46:57.813Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-06T15:46:57.813Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T15:46:57.813Z","stars":59,"forks":22}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Deployment mirror for the documentation app maintained in the Streamlit Shadcn UI repository. The main repository is the source of truth for Home.py, sitepages/, pages/, docs/components/, and the published migration guide.","The app uses Streamlit Components V2 with checked-in shadcn source backed by Base UI. It requires Python 3.10 or newer and Streamlit 1.60 or newer.","The deployed examples are pinned to streamlit-shadcn-ui==1.4.0. The Charts page demonstrates line, area, bar, pie, radar, and radial charts with shadcn's colorful light and dark palettes. Use Cases > V2 Elements demonstrates composing multiple controls in one React tree."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ObservedObserver/streamlit-shadcn-ui-docs/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"450f0f974b0d59bdb89b14e1872d95357251e7f6b993e9db026a4e680b693013","extractedAt":"2026-10-06T15:46:57.907Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T15:46:57.907Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Deployment mirror for the documentation app maintained in the Streamlit Shadcn UI repository. The main repository is the source of truth for Home.py, sitepages/, pages/, docs/components/, and the published migration guide.","sourceUrl":"https://githu